{"4036810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monster Market Simulator Modavuj Multiplayer", "steam_appid": 4036810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster Market Simulator Modavuj Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun business simulation where you build and grow your own market. Starting with a small shop, you'll deal with the whims of monster customers, stock the shelves, set prices, and ultimately strive to grow into a massive grocery empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/86659c10299f86f17338b2aed978f20f.poster.avif?t=1759995081\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/86659c10299f86f17338b2aed978f20f.webm?t=1759995081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/86659c10299f86f17338b2aed978f20f.mp4?t=1759995081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 Shelf Management – ​​Don't leave the shelves empty, or customers will look at you like, &quot;Is this a market or a warehouse?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 Price Setting – Sell cheaply, and customers will be happy. Sell expensively, and your coffers will fill up. But be careful, overdoing it will make you trend on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Customer Relations – Clear the queue quickly and avoid impatient customers grumbling at the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/4d3f4d56b6c0d19c366b8b45e00f69af.poster.avif?t=1759995081\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/4d3f4d56b6c0d19c366b8b45e00f69af.webm?t=1759995081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/4d3f4d56b6c0d19c366b8b45e00f69af.mp4?t=1759995081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 Inventory Management – ​​Don't let products run out; keep track of suppliers. Otherwise, customers will leave empty-handed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️ Market Expansion – Progress from a small market to a giant supermarket. Open new shelves and sell more products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Your Own Strategy – Whether you're a &quot;cheap hero&quot; or a &quot;high-priced but prestigious&quot; seller, this is your market, the decision is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? There's only one truth in this world: Empty shelves mean a worn-out customer. 😂</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster Market Simulator Modavuj Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun business simulation where you build and grow your own market. Starting with a small shop, you'll deal with the whims of monster customers, stock the shelves, set prices, and ultimately strive to grow into a massive grocery empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/86659c10299f86f17338b2aed978f20f.poster.avif?t=1759995081\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/86659c10299f86f17338b2aed978f20f.web